diff --git a/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..8c0f4f0
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr505.feature.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+All ``pysemver`` subcommands now accept an optional leading ``v`` or ``V`` on
+version arguments (for example a git tag like ``v1.4.2``). Output is printed
+without the prefix.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..ee5d1c5
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr506.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Passing a :class:`dict` to :meth:`semver.Version.compare` is deprecated and now
+emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use a string, a tuple/list or a
+:class:`~semver.Version` instance instead.
diff --git a/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
new file mode 100644
index 0000000..fe29924
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog.d/pr507.deprecation.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,4 @@
+The ``prerelease_token`` keyword of :meth:`semver.Version.next_version` is
+deprecated and emits a :class:`DeprecationWarning`. Use ``token`` instead,
+which matches :meth:`~semver.Version.bump_prerelease` and
+:meth:`~semver.Version.bump_build`.
